<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00656">
	<title>Decreasing set speed</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" outputclass="formatc" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25E058_1_2.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ul>
								<li>
									<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down and release it immediately. The set speed will decrease by 1 km/h (1 mph) each time the switch is operated in this manner.</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>Push the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) switch down and hold it. The set speed will decrease by 10 km/h (6 mph) each time the switch is operated in this manner.</p>
									<p>You can decrease the set speed to 30 km/h (20 mph).</p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p>If the speed unit on the instrument cluster is set to mph, the speed will increase in increments of 5.</p>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
	</conbody>
</concept>